cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the underlying paper."
title: PLMSommelier
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-08"
abstract: >-
  Given a dataset and a HuggingFace protein language model checkpoint, find
  the best layer for that dataset and return a truncated model. Implements
  the practical takeaway of "Task- and dataset-specific information in
  protein language models" (Joeres, Senatorov, Kolchina, Klakow & Kalinina,
  arXiv:2608.12090).
authors:
